docs {
  # Admin Create Slider

  Creates a home-screen slider/banner.

  ## Endpoint

  `POST /api/v1/admin/sliders`

  Requires admin JWT.

  ## Body Fields

  `title`
  Optional admin/customer label.

  `imageBase64`
  Recommended. Data URI or raw base64 image. Backend uploads it to Cloudinary.

  `imageUrl`
  Optional alternative. Use this if the image is already hosted. Send either
  `imageBase64` or `imageUrl`.

  `linkUrl`
  Optional clickable target. It can be an HTTPS URL, app deep link, or app path
  like `/services/data`. If empty, the frontend should not navigate on tap.

  `isActive`
  Optional. Defaults to `true`.

  `sortOrder`
  Optional. Lower numbers appear first.

  ## Expected Response

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Slider created successfully",
    "slider": {
      "id": "slider_id",
      "title": "Data promo",
      "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/.../banner.webp",
      "linkUrl": "/services/data",
      "isActive": true,
      "sortOrder": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
